| Comment: SSH Brute Force Detection
| MITRE ATT&CK: T1110.001 - Brute Force: Password Guessing
| Tactic: Credential Access
| Description: Detects 5+ failed SSH login attempts from the same IP within 1 minute
| Alert Schedule: Every 5 minutes | Severity: High

index="soc_lab" "Failed password"
| rex "from (?P<src_ip>\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+) port"
| bucket _time span=1m
| stats count by _time, src_ip
| where count >= 5
| sort -count
